In ServerScriptService, create a Script (not a LocalScript) named "ChristmasEvent". Paste #1 into it.

In StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts, create a LocalScript named "ChristmasClient". Paste #2 (Loader) into it.

Inside that LocalScript, create 3 ModuleScripts named exactly "M1", "M2", and "M3".

Paste all M1 parts into M1 in the correct order, one by one, adding each part at the bottom. Do the same for M2 and M3.

In-game commands:

- "/Christmas" – Start the event.
- "/Christmas stop" – Stop the event.
